/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Q1. Why do we take the harmonic mean of precision and recall when finding the F1-score and not simply the mean of the two metrics?)
/E (Q1. Why do we take the harmonic mean of precision and recall when finding the F1-score and not simply the mean of the two metrics?)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [0]
>>
